"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use sessions when you need dedicated and exclusive access to the QPU.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan Session saat kamu butuh akses eksklusif dan khusus ke QPU.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set up to use sessions {#set-up-to-use-sessions}"
msgstr "Persiapan untuk menggunakan Session {#set-up-to-use-sessions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before starting a session, you must [set up Qiskit Runtime](/guides/install-"
"qiskit) and initialize it as a service:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebelum memulai sebuah Session, kamu harus [menyiapkan Qiskit "
"Runtime](/guides/install-qiskit) dan menginisialisasinya sebagai layanan:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Open a session {#open-a-session}"
msgstr "Buka sebuah Session {#open-a-session}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can open a runtime session by using the context manager `with Session(...)` or by initializing the `Session`\n"
"class. When you start a session,  you must specify a QPU by passing a `backend` object. The session starts when its first job begins execution.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa membuka runtime Session menggunakan context manager `with "
"Session(...)` atau dengan menginisialisasi class `Session`. Saat memulai "
"Session, kamu harus menentukan QPU dengan meneruskan objek `backend`. "
"Session dimulai ketika job pertamanya mulai dieksekusi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"If you open a session but do not submit any jobs to it for 30 minutes, the session automatically closes.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Jika kamu membuka Session tapi tidak mengirimkan job apa pun ke dalamnya selama 30 menit, Session akan otomatis tertutup.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Session class**\n"
msgstr "**Class Session**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"The following code block will return an error for users on the Open Plan because it uses sessions. Workloads on the Open Plan can run only in [job mode](/guides/execution-modes#job-mode) or [batch mode](/guides/execution-modes#batch-mode).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"Blok kode berikut akan menghasilkan error bagi pengguna Open Plan karena menggunakan session. Workload di Open Plan hanya bisa dijalankan dalam [job mode](/guides/execution-modes#job-mode) atau [batch mode](/guides/execution-modes#batch-mode).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Context manager**\n"
msgstr "**Context manager**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The context manager automatically opens and closes the session.\n"
msgstr "Context manager secara otomatis membuka dan menutup Session.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"specify-length\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"specify-length\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Session length {#session-length}"
msgstr "Durasi Session {#session-length}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The maximum session time to live (TTL) determines how long a session can "
"run.  You can set this value with the `max_time` parameter. This should "
"exceed the longest job's execution time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maksimum time to live (TTL) Session menentukan berapa lama Session bisa "
"berjalan. Kamu bisa mengatur nilai ini dengan parameter `max_time`. Nilai "
"ini harus melebihi waktu eksekusi job terlama.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This timer starts when the session starts.  When the value is reached, the "
"session is closed.  Any jobs that are running will finish, but jobs still "
"queued are failed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Timer ini mulai berjalan saat Session dimulai. Ketika nilai tersebut "
"tercapai, Session ditutup. Job yang sedang berjalan akan selesai, tapi job "
"yang masih dalam antrian akan gagal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There is also an interactive time to live (interactive TTL) value that "
"cannot be configured.  If no session jobs are queued within that window, the"
" session is temporarily deactivated.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ada juga nilai interactive time to live (interactive TTL) yang tidak bisa "
"dikonfigurasi. Jika tidak ada session jobs yang masuk antrian dalam jendela "
"waktu tersebut, Session akan dinonaktifkan sementara.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Default values:\n"
msgstr "Nilai default:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Instance type (Open or Premium Plan) |  Interactive TTL | Maximum TTL |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Premium Plan | 60 sec* | 8 h* |\n"
"*\\* Certain Premium Plan instances might be configured to have a different value.*\n"
msgstr ""
"| Tipe instance (Open atau Premium Plan) | Interactive TTL | Maximum TTL |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Premium Plan | 60 detik* | 8 jam* |\n"
"*\\* Instans Premium Plan tertentu mungkin dikonfigurasi dengan nilai yang berbeda.*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To determine a session's max TTL or  interactive TTL, follow the "
"instructions in [Determine session details](#session-details) and look for "
"the `max_time`or `interactive_timeout` value, respectively.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengetahui max TTL atau interactive TTL sebuah Session, ikuti petunjuk"
" di [Tentukan detail Session](#session-details) dan cari nilai `max_time` "
"atau `interactive_timeout`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"ends\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"ends\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "End a session {#end-a-session}"
msgstr "Akhiri sebuah Session {#end-a-session}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "A session ends in the following circumstances:\n"
msgstr "Session berakhir dalam kondisi berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The maximum timeout (TTL) value is reached, resulting in the cancellation of"
" all queued jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nilai maksimum timeout (TTL) tercapai, yang mengakibatkan pembatalan semua "
"job dalam antrian.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The session is manually canceled, resulting in the cancellation of all "
"queued jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Session dibatalkan secara manual, yang mengakibatkan pembatalan semua job "
"dalam antrian.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The session is manually closed.  The session stops accepting new jobs but "
"continues to run queued jobs with priority.\n"
msgstr ""
"Session ditutup secara manual. Session berhenti menerima job baru tapi tetap"
" menjalankan job yang sudah dalam antrian dengan prioritas.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you use Session as a context manager, that is,  `with Session()`, the "
"session is automatically closed when the context ends (the same behavior as "
"using `session.close()`).\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika kamu menggunakan Session sebagai context manager, yaitu `with "
"Session()`, Session otomatis ditutup saat context berakhir (perilaku yang "
"sama dengan menggunakan `session.close()`).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"close\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"close\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Close a session {#close-a-session}"
msgstr "Tutup sebuah Session {#close-a-session}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A session automatically closes when it exits the context manager. When the "
"session context manager is exited, the session is put into \"In progress, "
"not accepting new jobs\" status. This means that the session finishes "
"processing all running or queued jobs until the maximum timeout value is "
"reached. After all jobs are completed, the session is immediately closed. "
"This allows the scheduler to run the next job without waiting for the "
"session interactive timeout, thereby reducing the average job queuing time. "
"You cannot submit jobs to a closed session.\n"
msgstr ""
"Session secara otomatis tertutup ketika keluar dari context manager. Saat "
"context manager Session keluar, Session masuk ke status \"In progress, not "
"accepting new jobs\". Artinya Session menyelesaikan semua job yang sedang "
"berjalan atau ada dalam antrian hingga nilai maksimum timeout tercapai. "
"Setelah semua job selesai, Session langsung ditutup. Ini memungkinkan "
"scheduler menjalankan job berikutnya tanpa menunggu session interactive "
"timeout, sehingga mengurangi rata-rata waktu antrian job. Kamu tidak bisa "
"mengirimkan job ke Session yang sudah ditutup.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"If you are not using a context manager, manually close the session to avoid unwanted cost. You can close a session as soon as you are done submitting jobs to it. When a session is closed with `session.close()`, it no longer accepts new jobs, but the already submitted jobs will still run until completion and their results can be retrieved.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Jika kamu tidak menggunakan context manager, tutup Session secara manual untuk menghindari biaya yang tidak diinginkan. Kamu bisa menutup Session segera setelah selesai mengirimkan job ke dalamnya. Ketika Session ditutup dengan `session.close()`, Session tidak lagi menerima job baru, tapi job yang sudah dikirimkan tetap akan berjalan hingga selesai dan hasilnya bisa diambil.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"session-status\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"session-status\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Check session status {#check-session-status}"
msgstr "Periksa status Session {#check-session-status}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can query a session's status to understand its current state by using  "
"`session.status()` or by viewing the "
"[Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa mengquery status Session untuk memahami kondisinya saat ini "
"menggunakan `session.status()` atau dengan melihat halaman "
"[Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Session status can be one of the following:\n"
msgstr "Status Session bisa berupa salah satu dari berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`Pending`: The session has not started or has been deactivated. The next "
"session job needs to wait in the queue like other jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"`Pending`: Session belum dimulai atau sudah dinonaktifkan. Job Session "
"berikutnya perlu menunggu dalam antrian seperti job lainnya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`In progress, accepting new jobs`: The session is active and accepting new "
"jobs.\n"
msgstr ""
"`In progress, accepting new jobs`: Session aktif dan menerima job baru.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`In progress, not accepting new jobs`: The session is active but not "
"accepting new jobs. Job submission to the session is rejected, but "
"outstanding session jobs will run to completion. The session is "
"automatically closed once all jobs finish.\n"
msgstr ""
"`In progress, not accepting new jobs`: Session aktif tapi tidak menerima job"
" baru. Pengiriman job ke Session ditolak, tapi job Session yang sudah ada "
"akan berjalan hingga selesai. Session otomatis ditutup setelah semua job "
"selesai.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`Closed`: The session's maximum timeout value has been reached or the "
"session was explicitly closed.\n"
msgstr ""
"`Closed`: Nilai maksimum timeout Session telah tercapai atau Session ditutup"
" secara eksplisit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"session-details\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"session-details\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Determine session details {#determine-session-details}"
msgstr "Tentukan detail Session {#determine-session-details}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For a comprehensive overview of a session's configuration and status, use "
"the  `session.details() method`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk gambaran menyeluruh tentang konfigurasi dan status Session, gunakan "
"metode `session.details()`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Usage patterns {#usage-patterns}"
msgstr "Pola penggunaan {#usage-patterns}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Sessions are especially useful for algorithms that require frequent "
"communication between classical and quantum resources.\n"
msgstr ""
"Session sangat berguna untuk algoritma yang memerlukan komunikasi sering "
"antara sumber daya klasik dan kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Example: Run an iterative workload that uses the classical SciPy optimizer "
"to minimize a cost function. In this model, SciPy uses the output of the "
"cost function to calculate its next input.\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh: Jalankan workload iteratif yang menggunakan optimizer SciPy klasik "
"untuk meminimalkan fungsi biaya. Dalam model ini, SciPy menggunakan output "
"dari fungsi biaya untuk menghitung inputnya berikutnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"two-vqe\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"two-vqe\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run two VQE algorithms in a session by using threading {#run-two-vqe-"
"algorithms-in-a-session-by-using-threading}"
msgstr ""
"Jalankan dua algoritma VQE dalam sebuah Session menggunakan threading {#run-"
"two-vqe-algorithms-in-a-session-by-using-threading}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can get more out of a session by running multiple workloads "
"simultaneously. The following example shows how you can run two VQE "
"algorithms, each using a different classical optimizer, simultaneously "
"inside a single session. Job tags are also used to differentiate jobs from "
"each workload.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa memaksimalkan Session dengan menjalankan beberapa workload secara "
"bersamaan. Contoh berikut menunjukkan cara menjalankan dua algoritma VQE, "
"masing-masing menggunakan optimizer klasik yang berbeda, secara bersamaan di"
" dalam satu Session. Tag job juga digunakan untuk membedakan job dari setiap"
" workload.\n"

